From: bherbruck <brennen.herbruck@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:10:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(ui): a refused Create click opens the tool library
 or the workspace list

Clicking a dark operation cell (or dropdown row) still names why on the
status line, and now also takes the user to the fix: with no fitting
tool the Tool library page opens; with a kind the mounted machine cannot
run the machine door opens on its workspace list.

Fixes #191

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
