From 69017d5bb0155df7d80392089f8aa4b401c04fc7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bherbruck <brennen.herbruck@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 20:03:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(ui): Create cells darken without stock and open the
 Stock page

Every ribbon-made operation machines the active setup's stock, so with
no stock the Create cells stayed lit and then refused "no stock; set up
stock first" on a dim status line. They now darken with a "set up stock
first" tip, and a click names it and opens the Stock page (#191's gate
route).

Fixes #216

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
